{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:3b6fb85edad0da889c149e5ac2ec6ba2cabd2bb41251adb0dba3b8d1899dfac6","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"6ba3bb6650e6ac6cb03130d3c33d9fb12fb1326fed4567b8e0e22204ced2554f","raw_text_sha256":"ba9c3ff7a1685fdd4ac64d07992a8904d7f6bf1c303459d00feadd25b8972bb5","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":3500,"start":3434,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"text":"监狱在大门内西向。旧分内外二监，乾隆三十年，知州万廷兰将外监归并内监，现在囚房六间，女囚房一间，狱神庙一间，禁卒房一间，更夫房一间。","text_sha256":"ba9c3ff7a1685fdd4ac64d07992a8904d7f6bf1c303459d00feadd25b8972bb5"},"before_sha256":"dbc5f861c73e22d307a2b61b2fb7a28b7d2d060917ec52b5ccd29b9d0be46deb","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"《光绪顺天府志》地理志四","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/NLG312001063940/chapter/1l93wyyn97p5n"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:8e10ad92bd8355b816a7ae6d8e6f5ec58a742979c2c8b2bf597f28b0eba44a56","sha256":"8e10ad92bd8355b816a7ae6d8e6f5ec58a742979c2c8b2bf597f28b0eba44a56"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:846da0b54c0afd523c610d0a59efa10077577b8cea08b72b8d4282a35755fa5b","sha256":"846da0b54c0afd523c610d0a59efa10077577b8cea08b72b8d4282a35755fa5b"},"id":"src:history:shuntianfu:prison-god","locator":{"phrase":"狱神庙一间","section":"州县衙署与监狱"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"只证明部分地方监狱可有狱神庙；不得泛化为每所监狱固定布局。","text":"監獄在大門內西向。舊分內外二監，乾隆三十年，知州萬廷蘭將外監歸併內監，現在囚房六間，女囚房一間，獄神廟一間，禁卒房一間，更夫房一間。","text_sha256":"7c1ea2f9276c38b0a20c9ca50e6cc99ee82dc3cd172707ff4e2c485dad7e7f54","title":"《光绪顺天府志》——监狱内狱神庙实例","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"地理志所载州署监狱实例；现代数字化容器","label":"《光绪顺天府志》","siglum":"GXS-TFZ"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h01:prison-god-space","claim_sha256":"68faef31742424b401eeeeb1a3481aec3d4f117b4e1a259373239400b7454bfb","rationale":"通州州治具体录文含“狱神庙一间”；现有主张的“部分监狱”范围与实例一致，没有普遍布局断言。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h01:prison-god-space","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"清代顺天府地方志实例显示部分监狱空间内可设狱神庙。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:shuntianfu:prison-god"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"167584586f73bcfc4fd53aa89d61106ba88703ffb36a13c2255bad7213c45be6","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["此项为代理对本地数字录文及下游主张的复核，不冒充独立人工评审；逐字重取不等于馆藏原件或历史真实性鉴定。","保留原Source ID、type、witness、tier、bibliography和notes，以及全部Claim、Decision、Implementation与TitleAxis记录和权限。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"rationale":"直接采用已接收识典页面显示的简体录文，撤回旧引文的未声明繁体字形整理。上下文为通州州治监狱实例，不扩大为全顺天府或一切清代监狱的固定布局。","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:shuntianfu:prison-god"}
